    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Score.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Score</code></a> from a plain <code>score</code> value using <a href=\"ScoringFunction.html#unspecified()\"><code>ScoringFunction.unspecified()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用<a href=\"ScoringFunction.html#unspecified()\"><code>ScoringFunction.unspecified()</code></a>从普通的<code>score</code>值创建一个新的<a href=\"Score.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Score</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Score.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Score</code></a> from a <code>score</code> value using the given <a href=\"ScoringFunction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>ScoringFunction</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据给定的<a href=\"ScoringFunction.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>ScoringFunction</code></a>，从<code>score</code>值创建一个新的<a href=\"Score.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的类\"><code>Score</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a <a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a> from the given minimum and maximum <code>Score</code> values.",
      "translation": "根据给定的最小和最大<code>Score</code>值创建一个<a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的类\"><code>Range</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"ScoringFunction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>ScoringFunction</code></a> that was used to compute this score.",
      "translation": "返回用于计算该分数的<a href=\"ScoringFunction.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>ScoringFunction</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the raw numeric value of the score.",
      "translation": "返回分数的原始数值。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Encapsulates the numeric score and the scoring function used to derive it. Scores are primarily used to rank search\nresults. Depending on the used <a href=\"ScoringFunction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>ScoringFunction</code></a> higher scores can indicate either a higher distance or a\nhigher similarity. Use the <a href=\"Similarity.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Similarity</code></a> class to indicate usage of a normalized score across representing\neffectively the similarity.",
      "translation": "封装了数值评分及其用于计算该评分的评分函数。评分主要用于对搜索结果进行排序。根据所使用的<a href=\"ScoringFunction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>ScoringFunction</code></a>，较高的分数可能表示更大的距离或更高的相似度。请使用<a href=\"Similarity.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Similarity</code></a>类来表明使用了归一化评分，该评分有效代表相似度。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
