      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>min</code> - the lower score value, must not be null.</dd>\n<dd><code>max</code> - the upper score value, must not be null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>a <a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a> over <a href=\"Score.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Score</code></a> bounds.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>min</code> - 最小分数值，不能为 null。</dd>\n<dd><code>max</code> - 最大分数值，不能为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>一个基于 <a href=\"Score.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Score</code></a> 边界的 <a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a>。</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>score</code> - the score value.</dd>\n<dd><code>function</code> - the scoring function that has computed the <code>score</code>.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>the new <a href=\"Score.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Score</code></a>.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>score</code> - 分数值。</dd>\n<dd><code>function</code> - 用于计算 <code>score</code> 的评分函数。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>新的 <a href=\"Score.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Score</code></a> 对象。</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
